ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-filtro-nuevo = Add filter
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-filtro-cambiar = Change filter
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-filtro-borrar = Delete filter
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-filtro-con-reglas = Only an empty filter can be deleted: delete its rules first, so the change can be undone.
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-no-reescribible = This rule uses something the router's web editor does not offer: the panel could not put it back as it was, so it neither changes nor deletes it.
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-filtro-no-reescribible = This filter has a name the router's web does not allow: the panel could not put it back as it was, so it neither changes nor deletes it.
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-form-regla = Change the rule
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-form-regla-nueva = New rule
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-form-filtro = Change the filter
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-form-filtro-nuevo = New filter
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-al-final = The new rule goes at the end of the filter, as in the router's web: the ones before it are checked first.
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-ayuda-direccion = Empty: any. Without a mask, only that address.
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-ayuda-puertos = Empty: all. Without the last one, only the first.
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-ayuda-nombre = Up to 16 letters, digits, spaces, dots, hyphens or underscores.
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-version-fija = A filter with rules keeps its address type: its rules are of that type.
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-elige = Choose an option
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-revisar = Review the change
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-editor-cancelar = Cancel
ajuste-seguridad-cortafuegos-error-campo = { $campo }: the value is not valid.
